# Hare Apparent: "When this creature enters, create a number of 1/1 white Rabbit creature tokens equal to the number of other
# creatures you control named Hare Apparent." On turn 1 Bot1 casts a first Hare (no other Hare, so no token; CR 111.1), then a
# second (one other Hare: one Rabbit); on turn 3 a third, which counts the two others and makes two more Rabbits.

